{title: Yours Forever, Amen}
{artist: C. Michael Pilato}
{genre: Modern Worship}
{style: Upbeat}
{flow: Closing}
{key: G}
{tempo: 130}
{time: 4/4}
{license: CC BY 3.0}
{copyright: © 2016 C. Michael Pilato}
{c: © 2016 C. Michael Pilato · Licence: CC BY 3.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/ · Source: https://github.com/cmpilato/worship-music/tree/main/Yours_Forever_Amen}
{c: Chords from the writer's own lead sheet (MusicXML in the source above)}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Oh, Abba Father, High King of Heaven,
[Em]Holy, [D]holy, is Your [C]Name.
[G]Your kingdom come and Your will be done in
[Em]Heaven a[D]bove and earth the [G]same.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Oh, Abba Father, High King of Heaven,
[Em]Give us [D]daily all we [C]need.
[G]And please forgive us, as we forgive those,
[Em]Who, like us, [D]caused Your Son to [C]bleed.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Yours for[Cadd9]ever is the kingdom! Yours for[Dsus]ever is the [D]power!
Yours for[Cadd9]ever is the glory, a[Dsus]men!
[G/B]Yours for[Cadd9]ever is the kingdom! Yours for[Dsus]ever is the [D]power!
Yours for[Cadd9]ever is the glory, a[Dsus]men! [D]A[G]men.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Oh, Abba Father, High King of Heaven,
[Em]Rescue us [D]from the evil [C]one,
[G]And lead us far from every temptation —
[Em]This bride keep [D]spotless for Your [C]Son.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[Em]To You, who's [D/F#]able to do (so much)
[G]More than we ask or (could) [C]even imagine,
[Em]Be endless glo[D/F#]ry, love and fame.
[G]Bring endless glory (to Your name)!
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 2}
Yours for[Cadd9]ever is the kingdom! Yours for[Dsus]ever is the [D]power!
Yours for[Cadd9]ever is the glory, a[Dsus]men!
[G/B]Yours for[Cadd9]ever is the kingdom! Yours for[Dsus]ever is the [D]power!
Yours for[Cadd9]ever is the glory, a[Dsus]men! [D]A[Cadd9]men.
[Dsus]Yours for[D]ever, [G/B]a[Cadd9]men.
[Dsus]Yours for[D]ever, a[G]men.
{end_of_chorus}
